## Third-party components

The plugin bundles third-party software into the shipped `main.js`. Their licences,
and the attribution each one requires, are listed in
[THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md](THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md). That file is generated from the
built bundle rather than maintained by hand. So a new dependency cannot be
bundled without appearing there.

This section is a pointer, not a copy, because that file is large. The
Apache-2.0 licence text alone runs to several thousand words. The file is also
regenerated on every dependency change, which a hand-edited section here could
not track.

This NOTICE file is provided for attribution purposes only and does not
modify the terms of the Apache License, Version 2.0.
